<title>SRI LANKA: Credit to Sri Lanka govt up 27.5 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Credit to Sri Lanka govt up 27.5 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank said on Monday that its credit to the government rose 27.5 percent to 47.6 billion rupees in January over the same period last year.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said its credit to the government in January 1996 was 37.3 billion rupees.</p>
</text>
